Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.32,0:20:32.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}My heart's deepest wish
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:32.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}is to not kneel before these mountains and rivers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.92,0:20:39.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't accept your doomed fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.48,0:20:39.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}karma can be changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.24,0:20:45.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Unwilling to let go,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.76,0:20:45.60,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}my obsessions propel me forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.60,0:20:53.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Don't be afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.92,0:20:53.12,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Thunder rumbles as I dare to tread through the reincarnation cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.08,0:20:57.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Accept your fate and stay mortal or defy it to become immortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.52,0:20:57.52,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,300)}Hold fast to this resolve and break through the obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.64,0:21:01.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I'll fight all those who dare to stand in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.96,0:21:01.36,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Let the winds of war heed my command.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.44,0:21:07.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I sign this question with my heart.
